     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Here's a little update for the retro fans! In version 1.0.1 you can now adjust various parameters of the CRT effect, such as brightness and curvature. Wanna know what it's like playing Chibi Ninja Shino-kun on a broken CRT? Put away that hammer and get the update!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
